&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://storybook.js.org&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Storybook&lt;/a&gt; is a development environment for UI components.
It allows you to browse a component library, view the different states of each component, and interactively develop and test components. Find out more at &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://storybook.js.org&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;https://storybook.js.org&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;center&gt;
  &lt;img src=&#34;https://raw.githubusercontent.com/storybookjs/storybook/master/media/storybook-intro.gif&#34; width=&#34;100%&#34; /&gt;
&lt;/center&gt;
&lt;p align=&#34;center&#34;&gt;
