&lt;p&gt;In order to continue improving your experience, we have to eventually deprecate certain addons in favor of new, better tools.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&amp;rsquo;re using info/notes, we highly recommend you to migrate to &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;addons/docs/&#34; &gt;docs&lt;/a&gt; instead, and &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;addons/docs/docs/recipes.md#migrating-from-notesinfo-addons&#34; &gt;here is a guide&lt;/a&gt; to help you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&amp;rsquo;re using contexts, we highly recommend you to migrate to &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/storybookjs/storybook/tree/next/addons/toolbars&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;toolbars&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/storybookjs/storybook/blob/next/MIGRATION.md#deprecated-addon-contexts&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;here is a guide&lt;/a&gt; to help you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;badges--presentation-materials&#34;&gt;Badges &amp;amp; Presentation materials
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;We have a badge! Link it to your live Storybook example.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/storybookjs/brand@master/badge/badge-storybook.svg&#34;
	
	
	
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;Storybook&#34;
	
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-md&#34; data-lang=&#34;md&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;[&lt;span class=&#34;nt&#34;&gt;![Storybook&lt;/span&gt;](&lt;span class=&#34;na&#34;&gt;https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/storybookjs/brand@master/badge/badge-storybook.svg&lt;/span&gt;)](link to site)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you&amp;rsquo;re looking for material to use in your presentation about storybook, like logo&amp;rsquo;s video material and the colors we use etc, you can find all of that at our &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/storybookjs/brand&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;brand repo&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;community-1&#34;&gt;Community
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tweeting via &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://twitter.com/storybookjs&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;@storybookjs&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
