    &gt;Medium&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Chatting on &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://discord.gg/storybook&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Discord&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Streaming saved at &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCr7Quur3eIyA_oe8FNYexfg&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Youtube&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
